OL,3,GNEWSAA proud past, but will high street
OL,4,Acash help town move forward?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGainsborough is proud of its past. In
OL,7,Fthe market square, large boards telling
OL,8,Fthe story of more than 1,000 years of
OL,9,Fhistory ` from the Viking era to the
OL,10,Fgolden age of manufacturing ` have been
OL,11,Fput up in empty shop windows.
OL,13,FBut on a weekday morning, the
OL,14,Fonce-bustling town centre is virtually
OL,15,Fempty.
OL,17,FThis week, the government said it would
OL,18,Fbring boarded-up high streets back to
OL,19,Flife with #210m of funding to turn
OL,20,Fderelict buildings into shared
OL,21,Fworkspaces, cafes and community hubs.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
